{
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Chapter 7: The War America Didn't Want to See",
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "s08b01",
     "shot": "my_lai",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "On March 16, 1968, American soldiers entered the South Vietnamese hamlet of My Lai.",
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true,
     "mood": "sombre",
     "amb": "wind",
     "date": 1968
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b02",
     "shot": "my_lai",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "They were searching for Viet Cong fighters.",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true,
     "mood": "sombre",
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b03",
     "shot": "my_lai",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Instead, they encountered unarmed civilians.",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true,
     "mood": "sombre",
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b04",
     "shot": "my_lai",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Over the course of the operation, American soldiers murdered hundreds of Vietnamese villagers,",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true,
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b05",
     "shot": "my_lai",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "including women, children, and elderly people.",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true,
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b06",
     "shot": "my_lai",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The final number is generally estimated at between 347 and 504 civilians,",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true,
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b07",
     "shot": "my_lai",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "depending on the accounting used.",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true,
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b08",
     "shot": "my_lai",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "There was no major battle at My Lai that could explain what happened.",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true,
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b09",
     "shot": "my_lai",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The victims were largely unarmed civilians.",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true,
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b10",
     "shot": "my_lai",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "One American helicopter pilot, Hugh Thompson Jr., witnessed the killings from the air.",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true,
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b11",
     "shot": "my_lai",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "He landed his helicopter between American soldiers and a group of surviving villagers.",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "whoosh",
       "w:landed",
       0.3
      ]
     ],
     "quiet": true,
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b12",
     "shot": "my_lai",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "He and his crew helped protect civilians and evacuate some of them.",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true,
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b13",
     "shot": "my_lai",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Thompson also reported what he had seen.",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true,
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b14",
     "shot": "covered",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "But the massacre was not immediately exposed to the American public.",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:not",
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b15",
     "shot": "covered",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The events were concealed and minimized for months.",
     "date": 1969,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:concealed",
       0.5
      ]
     ],
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b16",
     "shot": "covered",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "It was only in 1969, after investigations and reporting by journalist Seymour Hersh,",
     "date": 1969,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "paper",
       "w:Hersh,",
       0.5
      ]
     ],
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b17",
     "shot": "covered",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "that the story reached a wider audience.",
     "date": 1969,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b18",
     "shot": "covered",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The photographs were horrifying.",
     "date": 1969,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b19",
     "shot": "covered",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The accounts were even worse.",
     "date": 1969,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b20",
     "shot": "calley",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Of the American soldiers involved, Lieutenant William Calley was convicted of murder.",
     "date": 1971,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "w:convicted",
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b21",
     "shot": "calley",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "He was initially sentenced to life imprisonment, but his sentence was later reduced,",
     "date": 1971,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b22",
     "shot": "calley",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "and he served roughly three and a half years under house arrest.",
     "date": 1971,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b23",
     "shot": "symbol",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "For many Americans, My Lai became a symbol of everything that had gone wrong in Vietnam.",
     "date": 1969,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b24",
     "shot": "symbol",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "A war supposedly being fought to defend freedom had produced the slaughter of innocent people.",
     "date": 1969,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b25",
     "shot": "symbol",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "And it raised an uncomfortable question.",
     "date": 1969,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b26",
     "shot": "symbol",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "If American officials had been misleading the public about progress,",
     "date": 1969,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b27",
     "shot": "symbol",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "what else were they hiding?",
     "date": 1969,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b28",
     "shot": "nixon_in",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "By 1969, a new president was in the White House.",
     "date": 1969,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b29",
     "shot": "nixon_in",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Richard Nixon had promised to end the war.",
     "date": 1969,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:end",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b30",
     "shot": "nixon_in",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "But ending it would prove far more complicated than his campaign speeches suggested.",
     "date": 1969,
     "sfx": []
    }
   ],
   "mood": "sombre"
  }
 ]
}